      "prose": "Every build started from 1%, one hundredth of the amount. Taking $p$ lots of it gives $p\\%$: $$p\\% \\text{ of } A = p \\times \\frac{A}{100} = \\frac{p}{100} \\times A$$ 10% and 5% were shortcuts to the same answer.",
